  "body": "The algorithm for obtaining a responsible browsing context was present\non all environment settings objects. However, it was only used in Window\ncontexts. This replaces all usage sites with more direct references to\nthe browsing context in question.\n\nCloses #5422.\n\n---\n\nThis is on top of #5440 and so you should only review the second commit.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">/history.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/b954ac0...1639d7c/history.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">/webappapis.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/b954ac0...1639d7c/webappapis.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">/window-object.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/b954ac0...1639d7c/window-object.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">/workers.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/5441/b954ac0...1639d7c/workers.html\" title=\"Last updated on Apr 7, 2020, 4:19 PM UTC (1639d7c)\">diff</a> )",
